TI  - Memory-Decoupled Event-Driven SNN Deployment on Edge Microcontrollers
PY  - 2026
T2  - 2026 11th International Conference on Intelligent Computing and Signal Processing, ICSP 2026
SP  - 1313
EP  - 1317
DO  - 10.1109/ICSP69961.2026.11540798
