TI  - EdgeLoRA: An Efficient Multi-Tenant LLM Serving System on Edge Devices
PY  - 2025
T2  - MobiSys 2025 - Proceedings of the 23rd ACM international Conference on Mobile Systems, Applications, and Services
SP  - 138
EP  - 153
