TI  - Secure PUF-ASCON-Based Gateway-Assisted D2D Authentication for Resource-Constrained Smart-Manufacturing IIoT Devices
PY  - 2026
T2  - Mathematics
VL  - 14
IS  - 15
C7  - 2800
