TI  - Tracking Control of Quadrotor Micro Aerial Vehicles Using Efficient Nonlinear Model Predictive Control with C/GMRES Optimization on Resource-Constrained Microcontrollers
PY  - 2025
T2  - Electronics (Switzerland)
VL  - 14
IS  - 14
