TI  - Secure Command Authentication for Drone Control Using ECDSA
PY  - 2025
T2  - Proceedings - 2025 IEEE International Symposium on Smart Electronic Systems, iSES 2025
SP  - 417
EP  - 423
DO  - 10.1109/iSES67504.2025.00087
