TI  - Lightweight Secure Protocols for Low-Powered IoT Devices: Modern Ciphers, Authentication, and Machine Learning-Based Intrusion Detection †
PY  - 2026
T2  - Sensors
VL  - 26
IS  - 18
C7  - 5847
