TI  - GRALE: Integrating Graph-Based Reduction and Auxiliary Leakage Exploitation for Single-Trace Attack on NTT in ML-KEM
PY  - 2026
T2  - IEEE Internet of Things Journal
VL  - 13
IS  - 19
SP  - 45351
EP  - 45368
