TI  - AFST: Adaptive Frequency-Spatial Transform for real-time edge vision on resource-constrained microcontrollers
PY  - 2026
T2  - Journal of Real-Time Image Processing
VL  - 23
IS  - 4
C7  - 120
DO  - 10.1007/s11554-026-01905-0
