TI  - EffiE: Efficient Convolutional Neural Network for Real-Time EMG Pattern Recognition System on Edge Devices
PY  - 2023
T2  - International IEEE/EMBS Conference on Neural Engineering, NER
VL  - 2023-April
DO  - 10.1109/NER52421.2023.10123741
