TI  - A Continual and Incremental Learning Approach for TinyML On-device Training Using Dataset Distillation and Model Size Adaption
PY  - 2024
T2  - 2024 IEEE 7th International Conference on Industrial Cyber-Physical Systems, ICPS 2024
