TI  - Optimized Model Selection for Embedded Drowsiness Detection: A Comparative Study of MobileNetV2 and EfficientNet-B0 on ESP32-CAM
PY  - 2025
T2  - ICoAIT 2025 - 1st International Conference on Artificial Intelligence Technology - Artificial Intelligence: Driving Prosperity and Sustainability in the Modern World
SP  - 223
EP  - 228
DO  - 10.1109/ICoAIT67446.2025.11309086
