AB  - This paper presents a practical implementation of a side-channel attack using Correlation Power Analysis (CPA) against the ESP32-S3 microcontroller executing AES-128 encryption in software. Experimental procedures, attack methodology, and data acquisition techniques are discussed. Partial key recovery was achieved using modest equipment, demonstrating the vulnerability of embedded systems to side-channel attacks.  © 2025 IEEE.
