TI  - Avrntru: Lightweight NTRU-based Post-Quantum Cryptography for 8-bit AVR Microcontrollers
PY  - 2021
T2  - Proceedings -Design, Automation and Test in Europe, DATE
VL  - 2021-February
C7  - 9474033
